* ES-6 fixture: SELECT with cursor loop and END-SELECT terminator (structured mode)
* Valid Natural embedded SQL with loop body, demonstrating:
* - SELECT with INTO targets, FROM table, WHERE host-vars
* - Both colon-less (#A, #B) and colon-prefixed (:#K) host-var forms
* - Loop body with statements (PERFORM, CALLNAT)
* - Terminated with END-SELECT

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #A (A10)
  1 #B (A10)
  1 #K (N5)
END-DEFINE

SELECT COL1, COL2 INTO #A, #B FROM EMPLOYEES WHERE DEPT = :#K
  PERFORM CHECK-EMP
  CALLNAT 'PROCESS'
END-SELECT

END
